], [68, 29672], [76, 30455], [80, 31237]]}, {"verse": 7, "start": 32393, "end": 37161, "text": "To him that made great lights: for his mercy endures for ever:", "words": [[0, 32393], [3, 32513], [7, 32813], [12, 33473], [17, 33773], [23, 34113], [31, 35152], [35, 35277], [39, 35417], [45, 35777], [53, 36254], [57, 36730]]}, {"verse": 8, "start": 37611, "end": 41743, "text": "The sun to rule by day: for his mercy endures for ever:", "words": [[0, 37611], [4, 37710], [8, 38050], [11, 38290], [16, 38590], [19, 38830], [24, 39676], [28, 39798], [32, 39978], [38, 40358], [46, 40838], [50, 41318]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 42193, "end": 47054, "text": "The moon and stars to rule by night: for his mercy endures for ever.", "words": [[0, 42193], [4, 42323], [9, 42623], [13, 42883], [19, 43323], [22, 43683], [27, 44003], [30, 44263], [37, 45073], [41, 45197], [45, 45337], [51, 45797], [59, 46238], [63, 46680]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 47504, "end": 52436, "text": "To him that struck Egypt in their firstborn: for his mercy endures for ever:", "words": [[0, 47504], [3, 47627], [7, 47907], [12, 48147], [19, 48507], [25, 48947], [28, 49187], [34, 49307], [45, 50451], [49, 50554], [53, 50714], [59, 51174], [67, 51595], [71, 52016]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 52886, "end": 57199, "text": "And brought out Israel from among them: for his mercy endures for ever:", "words": [[0, 52886], [4, 53012], [12, 53272], [16, 53452], [23, 53872], [28, 54192], [34, 54492], [40, 55242], [44, 55346], [48, 55506], [54, 55926], [62, 56370], [66, 56813]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 57649, "end": 63015, "text": "With a strong hand, and with a stretched out arm: for his mercy endures for ever.", "words": [[0, 57649], [5, 57759], [7, 57899], [14, 58219], [20, 58779], [24, 59199], [29, 59359], [31, 59479], [41, 59799], [45, 60059], [50, 60921], [54, 61048], [58, 61208], [64, 61608], [72, 62098], [76, 62588]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 63465, "end": 68918, "text": "To him which divided the Red sea into parts: for 